OL,3,AMiliband says Israeli response to UK
OL,4,Asanctions on West Bank settlements
OL,5,A'deeply regrettable'
OL,6,
OL,7,FWithin hours, Israel responded with
OL,8,Ffour "counter-measures" against the UK
OL,9,F- including the closure of the UK
OL,10,Fconsulate in Jerusalem, which is
OL,11,Fexpected to shut in the next 30 days
OL,13,FIsrael is also banning 11 MPs from
OL,14,Fentering the country, including Zarah
OL,15,FSultana, Jeremy Corbyn, and Diane
OL,16,FAbbott
